ser_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Works now on first tag change.","commit_id":"03168ae577a7fe235f6aa16ad671bfff3206a6f0","state":"approved","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2996#pullrequestreview-3673537441","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/2996","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2996#pullrequestreview-3673537441"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/2996"}},"submitted_at":"2026-01-17T06:30:25Z","updated_at":"2026-01-17T06:30:25Z","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","event":"reviewed"},{"sha":"a8572fbfe6ebaa1282df5aa0f24ee0049087c78d","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKGE4NTcyZmJmZTZlYmFhMTI4MmRmNWFhMGYyNGVlMDA0OTA4N2M3OGQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/a8572fbfe6ebaa1282df5aa0f24ee0049087c78d","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/a8572fbfe6ebaa1282df5aa0f24ee0049087c78d","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-01-15T13:54:45Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-01-17T11:20:18Z"},"tree":{"sha":"28a2afb469b17546a1ba9123a32cb09c44ee81fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/28a2afb469b17546a1ba9123a32cb09c44ee81fc"},"message":"integration/tags: add dedicated issue #2978 reproduction test\n\nAdd TestTagsIssue2978ReproTagReplacement that specifically tests the\nscenario from issue #2978:\n- Register node with tag:foo via web auth with --advertise-tags\n- Admin changes tag to tag:bar via SetNodeTags\n- Verify client's self view updates (not just server-side)\n\nThe test performs multiple tag replacements with timing checks to\nverify whether tag updates propagate to the node's self view after\nthe first call (fixed behavior) or only after a redundant second\ncall (bug behavior).\n\nAdd helper functions for test validation:\n- assertNodeSelfHasTagsWithCollect: validates client's status.Self.Tags\n- assertNetmapSelfHasTagsWithCollect: validates client's netmap.SelfNode.Tags\n\nUpdates #2978","parents":[{"sha":"2e180d2587c56d0bc3e03daf1aa6807ff2587431","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/2e180d2587c56d0bc3e03daf1aa6807ff2587431","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/2e180d2587c56d0bc3e03daf1aa6807ff2587431"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"54c975c74a450f48bd735934a2f3a3bb33f780ee","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDU0Yzk3NWM3NGE0NTBmNDhiZDczNTkzNGEyZjNhM2JiMzNmNzgwZWU","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/54c975c74a450f48bd735934a2f3a3bb33f780ee","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/54c975c74a450f48bd735934a2f3a3bb33f780ee","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-01-15T13:56:11Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-01-17T11:20:18Z"},"tree":{"sha":"4d3ad90132a5a5e2946b112376d87ecc2a2b54e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/4d3ad90132a5a5e2946b112376d87ecc2a2b54e5"},"message":"integration/tags: add self-tag validation to existing tests\n\nUpdate 8 tests that involve admin tag assignment via SetNodeTags()\nto verify both server-side state and node self view updates:\n\n- TestTagsAuthKeyWithTagAdminOverrideReauthPreserves\n- TestTagsAuthKeyWithTagCLICannotModifyAdminTags\n- TestTagsAuthKeyWithoutTagCLINoOpAfterAdminWithReset\n- TestTagsAuthKeyWithoutTagCLINoOpAfterAdminWithEmptyAdvertise\n- TestTagsAuthKeyWithoutTagCLICannotReduceAdminMultiTag\n- TestTagsUserLoginCLINoOpAfterAdminAssignment\n- TestTagsUserLoginCLICannotRemoveAdminTags\n- TestTagsAdminAPICanSetUnownedTag\n\nEach test now validates that tag updates propagate to the node's\nown self view using assertNodeSelfHasTagsWithCollect, addressing\nthe issue #2978 scenario where tag changes were observed to\npropagate to peers but not to the node itself.\n\nUpdates #2978","parents":[{"sha":"a8572fbfe6ebaa1282df5aa0f24ee0049087c78d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/a8572fbfe6ebaa1282df5aa0f24ee0049087c78d","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/a8572fbfe6ebaa1282df5aa0f24ee0049087c78d"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"21da6e22a0ce4690fb9a1804f9d2fc1e193ca5a3","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDIxZGE2ZTIyYTBjZTQ2OTBmYjlhMTgwNGY5ZDJmYzFlMTkzY2E1YTM","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/21da6e22a0ce4690fb9a1804f9d2fc1e193ca5a3","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/21da6e22a0ce4690fb9a1804f9d2fc1e193ca5a3","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-01-15T13:56:48Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-01-17T11:20:18Z"},"tree":{"sha":"94850d6b046ff69f0544bfad07389129851d2047","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/94850d6b046ff69f0544bfad07389129851d2047"},"message":"hscontrol: fix tag updates not propagating to node self view\n\nWhen SetNodeTags changed a node's tags, the node's self view wasn't\nupdated. The bug manifested as: the first SetNodeTags call updates\nthe server but the client's self view doesn't update until a second\ncall with the same tag.\n\nRoot cause: Three issues combined to prevent self-updates:\n\n1. SetNodeTags returned PolicyChange which doesn't set OriginNode,\n   so the mapper's self-update check failed.\n\n2. The Change.Merge function didn't preserve OriginNode, so when\n   changes were batched together, OriginNode was lost.\n\n3. generateMapResponse checked OriginNode only in buildFromChange(),\n   but PolicyChange uses RequiresRuntimePeerComputation which\n   bypasses that code path entirely and calls policyChangeResponse()\n   instead.\n\nThe fix addresses all three:\n- state.go: Set OriginNode on the returned change\n- change.go: Preserve OriginNode (and TargetNode) during merge\n- batcher.go: Pass isSelfUpdate to policyChangeResponse so the\n  origin node gets both self info AND packet filters\n- mapper.go: Add includeSelf parameter to policyChangeResponse\n\nFixes #2978","parents":[{"sha":"54c975c74a450f48bd735934a2f3a3bb33f780ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/54c975c74a450f48bd735934a2f3a3bb33f780ee","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/54c975c74a450f48bd735934a2f3a3bb33f780ee"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"id":22112246723,"node_id":"HRFPE_lADOEFLz887iSPbIzwAAAAUl_hvD","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/22112246723","actor":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"head_ref_force_pushed","commit_id":"21da6e22a0ce4690fb9a1804f9d2fc1e193ca5a3","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kradalby/heads